  "keyFeatures": [
    "Ansible-driven automated deployment of 100+ Docker-containerized services",
    "Traefik reverse proxy with automatic TLS via Let's Encrypt or ZeroSSL",
    "Rclone cloud storage mounts with UnionFS for transparent local/remote media access",
    "Cloudplow automated media upload to cloud remotes",
    "Authelia / Authentik SSO and 2FA for all services",
    "Flexible multi-instance role architecture (e.g. multiple Sonarr/Radarr instances)",
    "Cloudflare DNS integration with automatic record management",
    "Built-in backup and restore with local, rclone, and rsync destinations",
    "CrowdSec integration for intrusion detection",
    "Support for Plex, Emby, and Jellyfin media servers"
  ],
